WEBVTT

00:10.380 --> 00:13.670
Hey... where's Asaka-san?

00:17.460 --> 00:19.500
What in the world is going on?!

00:19.500 --> 00:22.960
You said you weren't going to hurt anyone!

00:23.210 --> 00:24.500
Shut up!

00:26.290 --> 00:29.000
Asaka-san! I finally found you!

00:29.000 --> 00:32.380
Huh? Yogiri-kun, what are you doing he-

00:33.170 --> 00:36.420
Don't do a thing.
Move a muscle and I'll kill her!

00:36.420 --> 00:37.750
Ouch! That hurts!

00:37.750 --> 00:38.460
You tell him to stay where he is, too!

00:38.460 --> 00:40.000
Come on, take it easy...
You tell him to stay where he is, too!<b></b>

00:40.000 --> 00:41.210
You tell him to stay where he is, too!

00:41.420 --> 00:42.960
If you don't, she'll di-

00:48.830 --> 00:50.960
What's going on?

00:52.670 --> 00:54.080
Let's go home.

00:55.000 --> 00:56.580
Yogiri-kun...

01:03.170 --> 01:04.250
Hey...

01:05.130 --> 01:06.130
Hey!

01:07.000 --> 01:09.210
C'mon, wake up! Hey!

01:11.040 --> 01:12.500
Asaka-san?

01:14.710 --> 01:16.130
Who are you?

01:16.790 --> 01:18.790
Tomochika Dannoura!

01:21.170 --> 01:24.210
Dannoura-san, are we already there?

01:25.500 --> 01:29.000
How did you stay asleep
during such a huge ruckus?!

01:31.000 --> 01:32.750
What's with all this?

01:32.750 --> 01:34.330
The heck should I know?!

01:37.670 --> 01:38.710
A snake?

01:38.710 --> 01:40.580
No, a lizard?

01:48.500 --> 01:50.330
A wyvern, huh?

01:52.080 --> 01:53.170
Here it comes!

01:55.500 --> 01:57.420
We're done for!

02:16.250 --> 02:17.580
Dannoura-san.

02:18.580 --> 02:20.330
Looks like you're saved.

02:20.670 --> 02:22.080
Really?

02:22.750 --> 02:25.330
What is happening?

02:25.830 --> 02:30.210
That's what I'd like to ask,
but calm down first.

02:30.710 --> 02:32.710
Now, let's talk.

02:34.210 --> 02:38.210
You're really gonna game at a time like this?!

04:08.500 --> 04:12.380
<b>"Instant Death Ability"</b>

04:13.580 --> 04:14.880
Hey.

04:15.250 --> 04:17.330
Wanna get outta here already?

04:17.330 --> 04:21.580
And do what?
There's no guarantee we'll be safe.

04:21.920 --> 04:25.670
Your calm, cool,
and collected attitude is totally fine,

04:25.670 --> 04:28.290
but please don't say that while you're gaming.

04:30.130 --> 04:31.630
Have you calmed down?

04:32.420 --> 04:33.830
I guess so.

04:34.130 --> 04:36.040
Tell me what happened.

04:36.040 --> 04:37.080
Okay...

04:39.130 --> 04:43.880
We were on the bus heading to our field trip.

04:44.250 --> 04:46.960
On the other side of the tunnel...

04:48.130 --> 04:49.130
Wha?!

04:49.130 --> 04:50.960
...there was a sunny meadow.

04:55.460 --> 04:57.830
Mikochi, what the heck is this?

04:58.500 --> 05:00.540
A meadow, maybe?

05:03.460 --> 05:05.330
A pleasure to meet you all.

05:05.670 --> 05:09.290
I am the sage, Shion.

05:09.460 --> 05:11.130
Who the hell are you?!

05:13.040 --> 05:14.130
Huh?

05:16.250 --> 05:18.460
Please don't make a racket.

05:18.460 --> 05:22.210
Focus your attention on me only.

05:24.920 --> 05:29.000
I have no intention
of causing you harm directly,

05:29.000 --> 05:32.290
but if you anger me,
I can make no guarantees.

05:32.540 --> 05:36.420
My attack power is 530,000.

05:37.790 --> 05:41.460
Ah, this is where you should laugh.

05:44.750 --> 05:48.670
My joke bombed and it angered me,
so I killed him.

05:52.130 --> 05:57.080
Now then, this is an isekai to all of you.

05:57.080 --> 06:01.290
I summoned you all here as prospective sages.

06:01.880 --> 06:05.000
This world is ruled by sages,

06:05.000 --> 06:08.500
but sometimes it's necessary
to replenish our numbers.

06:13.540 --> 06:14.500
Huh?

06:16.750 --> 06:20.710
What's going on?
And like, why am I not glowing?

06:20.710 --> 06:26.170
I installed a system called
"Battle Song" in all of you.

06:27.000 --> 06:31.080
A logo image from the license
should be in your field of vision.

06:31.460 --> 06:34.380
Mikochi, are you looking at something?

06:34.380 --> 06:38.830
Yeah, there's writing I can't understand
but it's right in front of me.

06:38.830 --> 06:42.380
<b>Class: Necromancer</b>

06:38.830 --> 06:42.380
<b>Stats</b>

06:39.130 --> 06:41.420
Oh, these are my stats.

06:41.920 --> 06:46.290
This system is called a "gift" in this world.

06:46.790 --> 06:50.750
Make good use of it and aim to become a sage.

06:50.920 --> 06:54.290
You'll have a time limit of one month.

06:54.290 --> 06:55.460
'Scuse me!

06:55.460 --> 06:59.330
I didn't glow, and I can't see
any logo or anything...

06:59.500 --> 07:01.630
My goodness...

07:01.630 --> 07:04.880
Well there are some people
who aren't a good match for this.

07:05.170 --> 07:06.830
Just accept it.

07:06.830 --> 07:07.960
Huh?!

07:08.250 --> 07:10.750
If you can't become a sage,

07:10.750 --> 07:14.920
shall I turn you into livestock
with all of your magic wrung out?

07:15.170 --> 07:16.420
Livestock?

07:17.040 --> 07:20.290
Your first mission will begin in one hour.

07:18.000 --> 07:21.630
<b>First mission</b>

07:20.290 --> 07:22.920
Don't get wiped out, okay?

07:21.630 --> 07:23.790
<b>Time until first mission</b>

07:27.250 --> 07:28.920
What is all this about?

07:28.920 --> 07:32.040
Oh, it's showing
the explanation of the mission.

07:32.540 --> 07:34.080
<b>Dragon (average level 1000)</b>

07:32.540 --> 07:34.080
<b>A dragon's favorite dish is humans.</b>

07:32.540 --> 07:34.080
<b>Leaving the bus without a strategy</b>

07:32.540 --> 07:34.080
<b>will certainly lead to an attack.</b>

07:32.670 --> 07:36.000
It says a dragon is coming to attack.

07:34.080 --> 07:35.960
<b>And, you cannot defeat a dragon</b>

07:34.080 --> 07:35.960
<b>at your current levels.</b>

07:34.080 --> 07:35.960
<b>The bus is safe because it is being</b>

07:34.090 --> 07:35.960
<b>protected by a mystical barrier</b>

07:34.090 --> 07:35.960
<b>until the mission starts. Come up</b>

07:34.090 --> 07:35.960
<b>with a game plan before acting.</b>

07:36.000 --> 07:38.630
Uh, no way, a dragon?

07:38.630 --> 07:40.330
Everyone, listen up!

07:41.170 --> 07:44.880
It looks like we have no choice
but to clear this mission.

07:44.880 --> 07:47.790
<b>(General)</b>

07:44.880 --> 07:47.790
<b>Has the leadership ability to rally a large group</b>

07:44.880 --> 07:47.790
<b>of people towards a single goal and act on it.</b>

07:45.330 --> 07:47.830
We're gonna have to work together to do that.

07:48.420 --> 07:50.500
Tell me all of your stats!

07:51.790 --> 07:52.380
Everyone has pretty different abilities.

07:52.250 --> 07:53.330
<b>Yui Otani</b>

07:52.250 --> 07:53.330
<b>Class: Cheerleader</b>

07:52.250 --> 07:53.330
<b>Raises others abilities with cheers</b>

07:52.380 --> 07:54.500
We need to help each other with this.
Everyone has pretty different abilities.<b></b>

07:54.500 --> 07:56.710
We're all sorted then, right?

07:59.880 --> 08:02.880
The ones who didn't glow are me, and...

08:03.080 --> 08:06.460
Why'd this have to happen to me?!

08:06.460 --> 08:08.170
Shinozaki-san, and...

08:08.960 --> 08:11.000
Kiryuu-kun, um...

08:11.330 --> 08:13.290
That's Takatou-kun, I think?

08:13.290 --> 08:16.830
Is he seriously sleeping at a time like this?

08:17.080 --> 08:23.040
Yeah, I don't remember Takatou-kun
doing anything aside from sleeping.

08:27.630 --> 08:30.080
And not a single word to us?

08:30.330 --> 08:31.790
Let's go.

08:32.380 --> 08:34.040
Takatou-kun.

08:34.040 --> 08:36.750
Everyone's leaving, wake up.

08:36.920 --> 08:38.380
Just leave him there.

08:38.380 --> 08:40.460
He likes sleeping, right?

08:40.460 --> 08:42.580
And just what do you suppose we do?

08:43.460 --> 08:47.210
Sorry, but you guys just stay here.

08:47.210 --> 08:50.790
Why are you freaking cutting us off,
you think you're some sort of big shot?!

08:50.960 --> 08:52.880
I'm a general, you know.

08:57.040 --> 09:02.880
Those who have received gifts have this degree
of enhanced physical ability even at level 1.

09:02.880 --> 09:07.210
You all have no abilities,
and bringing you along will be a burden.

09:09.210 --> 09:13.460
Doesn't having that power
mean you can protect us?!

09:13.920 --> 09:17.670
Having you all stay here is a strategy.

09:17.880 --> 09:19.130
A strategy?

09:21.630 --> 09:23.790
Okay, I'm gonna make everyone

09:22.330 --> 09:25.080
<b>(Beauty Coordinator)</b>

09:22.330 --> 09:25.080
<b>Specializes in a skill that increases and decreases</b>

09:22.340 --> 09:25.080
<b>a target's attractiveness. Can use aggro management.</b>

09:23.790 --> 09:25.420
even more attractive!

09:25.420 --> 09:28.000
Charm up!

09:30.250 --> 09:33.130
Asun? Did you do something?

09:33.580 --> 09:36.540
Everyone's ridiculously good-looking now!

09:38.830 --> 09:41.920
There's just one dragon in this area.

09:41.920 --> 09:47.790
If you guys can act as decoys,
everyone else can safely reach the city.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.380
Decoys?!

09:49.380 --> 09:52.380
Are you saying everyone
agreed to this strategy?!

09:52.380 --> 09:55.330
Like, Mikochi would never go for this!

09:56.040 --> 09:58.790
By Mikochi you mean, Jogasaki-kun, right?

09:59.040 --> 10:00.880
Of course she agreed to it.

10:04.880 --> 10:05.920
Wait!

10:05.920 --> 10:07.000
Dammit!

10:07.290 --> 10:08.580
It's locked!

10:08.580 --> 10:10.960
Why is this happening?!

10:11.130 --> 10:12.750
What are we gonna do?

10:13.750 --> 10:14.920
Huh?

10:15.170 --> 10:17.500
The window! Get out through the window!

10:18.960 --> 10:20.920
Is that a dragon?

10:34.250 --> 10:35.750
And now we're here.

10:36.210 --> 10:39.540
Someone was still sleeping peacefully
through the whole thing, though.

10:41.420 --> 10:45.500
How am I supposed to charge
my gaming device in an isekai?

10:45.500 --> 10:47.420
THAT'S what you're worried about?!

10:48.750 --> 10:52.790
If we're to believe Yazaki,
then there's only one dragon.

10:52.790 --> 10:55.500
If that's the case,
then it should be safe outside.

10:55.500 --> 10:56.630
Hey...

10:57.130 --> 10:58.380
Um...

10:58.790 --> 11:01.380
Did you do something, Takatou-kun?

11:01.630 --> 11:04.500
We crashed and now we're dead.

11:04.500 --> 11:06.460
That sounds like a filthy lie!

11:06.460 --> 11:08.540
You don't have to believe me.

11:08.540 --> 11:09.670
Hmm...

11:14.710 --> 11:19.830
Hill, city, or forest...
Those are our three choices, huh?

11:19.830 --> 11:22.170
Maybe we should skip the forest.

11:22.170 --> 11:23.080
Hey...

11:23.830 --> 11:26.170
I think something's flying this way.

11:26.170 --> 11:27.630
Is it a dragon?

11:28.000 --> 11:29.210
No.

11:30.460 --> 11:34.880
Higashida-kun, Fukuhara-kun,
and Hanakawa-kun are flying toward us...

11:34.880 --> 11:36.040
What?!

11:36.040 --> 11:38.580
How can you tell from so far away?

11:39.130 --> 11:40.790
Should I go ahead and kill them?

11:40.790 --> 11:41.920
Yeah, sure!

11:41.920 --> 11:43.830
If your classmates are flying in the sky,

11:43.830 --> 11:45.670
the first thing you should do
is murder 'em, right?

11:45.670 --> 11:46.920
The heck is wrong with you?!

11:47.750 --> 11:52.380
Leaving us behind here
is something a killer would do.

11:54.290 --> 11:57.290
That doesn't mean
you have to talk about killing them.

11:58.210 --> 12:00.170
Even if we aren't out to get them,

12:00.170 --> 12:04.040
it's still possible that
they'll be hostile towards us.

12:04.040 --> 12:04.880
Huh?

12:06.290 --> 12:10.250
What's this?! The dragon is dead?!

12:10.460 --> 12:12.710
Well that saves us a lot of trouble.

12:12.710 --> 12:13.710
Oh?

12:14.420 --> 12:16.920
Tomochika-tan is alive!

12:18.170 --> 12:20.250
This is unexpected!

12:20.250 --> 12:24.210
<b>(Healer)</b>

12:20.250 --> 12:24.210
<b>Specializes in recovery,</b>

12:20.250 --> 12:24.210
<b>unimposing as an adventurer.</b>

12:20.710 --> 12:23.540
Our plans to turn her corpse into a zombie

12:23.540 --> 12:25.580
and go wild have been ruined!

12:25.960 --> 12:27.460
I told you there was a chance

12:25.960 --> 12:28.830
<b>(Hero)</b>

12:25.960 --> 12:28.830
<b>Offensive and defensive all-rounder.</b>

12:25.960 --> 12:28.830
<b>Can equip all weapons and use basic magic.</b>

12:27.460 --> 12:28.880
she'd be alive, didn't I?

12:29.290 --> 12:33.250
<b>(Necromancer)</b>

12:29.290 --> 12:33.250
<b>Turns the deceased into zombies</b>

12:29.290 --> 12:33.250
<b>and can use them freely.</b>

12:29.460 --> 12:30.790
I mean, the idea of

12:30.790 --> 12:33.290
making and controlling her as a zombie

12:33.290 --> 12:34.500
is pretty creepy, you know...

12:34.500 --> 12:36.330
Don't say anymore than that.

12:36.330 --> 12:39.420
Dannoura-san is already freaked out.

12:39.750 --> 12:44.380
Well, I just now understood clearly
that we can't be friends.

12:45.290 --> 12:47.420
Fireball!

12:50.000 --> 12:51.000
Huh?

12:54.040 --> 12:58.380
Lord Higashida's fireball
is rather unconventional, isn't it?

12:58.380 --> 13:03.080
Since I can't use anything but basic magic,
I kept refining it.

13:03.380 --> 13:05.580
Good thing you're a hero, Higashida.

13:05.580 --> 13:09.170
I'm just an upstart necromancer, you know?

13:09.710 --> 13:11.500
There's no point in resisting.

13:11.500 --> 13:13.790
Come here, Dannoura.

13:14.080 --> 13:15.750
Why would you do that?!

13:15.920 --> 13:20.130
I decided that at my next chance,
I'd do whatever I wanted.

13:20.130 --> 13:22.080
And first is Dannoura-san.

13:22.080 --> 13:27.250
You're the kind of girl I dream about nightly!

13:27.670 --> 13:30.750
What?! You're trying to get with me?!

13:30.920 --> 13:34.960
I'm impressed you've got the guts to say that
in this situation, Dannoura-san.

13:35.170 --> 13:37.540
You two seem to be quite buddy-buddy.

13:37.750 --> 13:40.920
I'll put us in a position
to talk things out for now.

13:40.920 --> 13:41.710
Huh?

13:46.670 --> 13:47.670
Die.

13:49.130 --> 13:52.170
Hilarious! What could "Die" possibly do?

13:52.170 --> 13:54.960
Your vocabulary is so miniscule
it's unbelieva-

13:55.380 --> 13:56.420
What?!

13:57.250 --> 14:00.210
Lord Higashida?
What has happened to you?!

14:00.500 --> 14:02.920
He died because I told him to,

14:02.920 --> 14:05.420
how hard can it be to figure out
cause and effect?

14:05.420 --> 14:06.960
So don't move.

14:07.210 --> 14:08.330
Higashida!

14:08.330 --> 14:09.290
Die.

14:11.130 --> 14:12.130
Huh?

14:12.130 --> 14:14.080
I said not to move, didn't I?

14:15.380 --> 14:17.330
If you move, you die.

14:17.330 --> 14:18.630
Got that?

14:18.790 --> 14:21.040
Uh, well...

14:22.000 --> 14:25.500
Now then, I'll explain my ability.

14:37.250 --> 14:41.920
Can you check if those guys
are actually dead for me?

14:42.420 --> 14:44.500
I won't kill you if you move.

14:48.710 --> 14:49.960
Heal!

14:54.420 --> 14:56.790
I am a healer!

14:56.790 --> 15:01.830
No matter how grave the injury,
I can heal it instantly with my recovery magic.

15:02.290 --> 15:04.210
Except they aren't moving?!

15:04.210 --> 15:06.000
Do you get it now?

15:06.000 --> 15:08.540
So what happened to the dragon was...

15:08.540 --> 15:10.500
Explaining it is a pain.

15:10.750 --> 15:12.790
A pain? Are you kidding me?!

15:12.790 --> 15:17.210
Hanakawa seems stupid,
and if I don't explain it to him properly,

15:17.210 --> 15:19.210
he'd just start another fight, right?

15:19.580 --> 15:20.880
True enough...

15:23.290 --> 15:25.170
You've come out of nowhere with this...

15:26.130 --> 15:28.000
You've gone too far!

15:28.250 --> 15:31.130
I only hit back because I was attacked.

15:32.500 --> 15:37.040
My ability is called
"Instant Death to Any Target."

15:37.540 --> 15:41.630
If I simply think that I want to kill someone,
they immediately die.

15:41.630 --> 15:44.750
No! That is beyond absurd!

15:44.750 --> 15:47.670
Shall we test it out if you don't believe me?

15:47.670 --> 15:49.420
I understand!

15:49.420 --> 15:53.830
So please stop looking at me
like you want to kill me!

15:54.630 --> 15:55.880
Okay, stop.

15:55.880 --> 15:58.330
Wh-what is it?

15:58.330 --> 16:00.330
You were trying to do something
just now, right?

16:00.330 --> 16:03.880
Wh-what are you talking about?

16:03.880 --> 16:10.710
I also have the ability to determine
if there is any intent to kill aimed at me.

16:10.920 --> 16:12.290
What?!

16:12.290 --> 16:15.790
And, when you combine those two abilities,

16:15.790 --> 16:20.790
it's also possible that my target will die
just by having the intent to kill me.

16:21.630 --> 16:25.750
How's anyone supposed to win against that?!

16:25.920 --> 16:33.460
Why are you so full of yourselves
after just receiving your gift?

16:34.080 --> 16:39.380
This isn't the first time
we've come to this world.

16:41.250 --> 16:44.500
It was a short time ago...

16:44.500 --> 16:51.380
The magician of the Kingdom of Iman
summoned us to defeat the demon lord.

16:51.540 --> 16:55.630
So basically, you three adventured
in this world for about a year,

16:55.630 --> 16:59.210
and the moment you defeated the demon lord
you were returned to our original world.

16:59.210 --> 17:03.130
I would appreciate you not summarizing
my heroic tale so lightly!

17:03.750 --> 17:06.580
Were those guys absent from school?

17:06.580 --> 17:09.080
I don't think they were.

17:09.250 --> 17:14.000
When we returned home,
merely a few hours had passed.

17:14.000 --> 17:17.460
Then there's a possibility
that we can go back, too.

17:17.460 --> 17:20.040
Wait! Wait just a moment!

17:20.040 --> 17:22.790
I'm just getting rid of future problems.

17:22.790 --> 17:25.290
Please, spare my life!

17:26.000 --> 17:27.250
Uh...

17:27.250 --> 17:30.250
Dannoura-san, what do you think about this?

17:30.250 --> 17:34.580
Do you think you could smooth things out
between Lord Takatou and me?

17:35.130 --> 17:40.080
I'm safe right now
because Takatou-kun saved me.

17:41.170 --> 17:44.000
I don't think I have a say in this.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.040
No!

17:45.040 --> 17:48.130
Tomochika-tan! You are surprisingly cold!

17:48.540 --> 17:49.750
I've got it!

17:50.670 --> 17:54.330
With this, I can become your servant,
Tomochika-tan!

17:54.540 --> 17:57.960
This is an ultra-rare magic item
and putting it on

17:57.960 --> 18:01.210
will make you unable to disobey
the first person you see!

18:01.500 --> 18:03.330
You put it on like this, and...

18:04.380 --> 18:08.420
Master! Your wish is my desire!

18:08.420 --> 18:10.210
Ew! Get away!

18:13.000 --> 18:15.420
Like, that's seriously gross.

18:15.420 --> 18:18.330
Is there no way to stop being the master?

18:18.630 --> 18:20.250
I don't want to say...

18:20.250 --> 18:23.290
But I can't disobey your order!

18:23.290 --> 18:26.920
You can transfer me to another person.

18:26.920 --> 18:29.290
Okay then, I'm handing you over to Takatou-kun!

18:29.290 --> 18:30.750
NO!

18:30.750 --> 18:35.750
I was hoping I could be kept
as Tomochika-tan's servant!

18:36.080 --> 18:39.630
Fine. I won't kill you.

18:39.630 --> 18:41.080
Really?!

18:41.830 --> 18:43.710
You see that forest over there?

18:43.710 --> 18:44.330
Huh?

18:45.000 --> 18:47.080
That's a forest full of magical beasts.

18:47.460 --> 18:49.830
Stand and wait there.

18:49.830 --> 18:52.040
Did you hear me?!

18:52.040 --> 18:55.130
That place is crawling with monsters!

18:55.750 --> 18:58.080
My legs! They've a mind of their own!

18:58.080 --> 18:59.250
Oh, almost forgot.

18:59.250 --> 19:01.630
May I assume that was all in jest?

19:02.130 --> 19:04.880
Don't say a word about us to anyone else.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.710
Is that all?

19:07.710 --> 19:09.000
And also...

19:09.000 --> 19:10.580
What can I do for you?

19:10.580 --> 19:13.790
Leave anything of value that you have here.

19:14.170 --> 19:17.290
And I worked so hard
on my last adventure to get them!

19:17.290 --> 19:20.040
Who would go and rob a guy like that?!

19:20.040 --> 19:22.420
This is most unfair, Master!

19:22.420 --> 19:24.040
Are you sure about this?

19:24.040 --> 19:27.210
We don't know when he'll betray us.

19:27.380 --> 19:30.790
Well then, what about me?

19:30.790 --> 19:34.500
I may suddenly turn on you, you know?

19:34.830 --> 19:37.080
If it happens, it happens.

19:37.080 --> 19:41.000
I'm the one that chose
to protect you, Dannoura-san.

19:41.000 --> 19:44.880
Um, I don't know how to say this, but...

19:45.710 --> 19:50.880
You and I have never spoken
this much before, right?

19:51.540 --> 19:53.580
So why, um...

19:53.580 --> 19:56.630
Why are you doing so much to protect me?

19:57.000 --> 19:58.330
Huh?

19:58.330 --> 20:00.580
Now that you mention it, I don't know.

20:00.580 --> 20:03.500
No, no, no, there's gotta be something, right?

20:03.830 --> 20:09.920
Something like, you just started
wanting to protect me in spite of yourself?

20:09.920 --> 20:11.000
Oh, yeah!

20:11.000 --> 20:13.960
Huh? Did something come to mind?

20:14.130 --> 20:18.670
When the dragon came to attack,
and you grabbed me...

20:23.380 --> 20:25.750
your boobs were soft?

20:28.040 --> 20:33.380
There are zero good men in this world, dammit!

20:46.210 --> 20:47.540
Sage Shion.

20:48.580 --> 20:52.500
Oh? Youichi-kun, what's happened?

20:53.880 --> 20:57.080
You were the one who asked for a status report.

20:57.080 --> 21:01.290
We're alone here,
you don't need to talk to me like that.

21:01.630 --> 21:04.000
It's about the prospective sages.

21:04.000 --> 21:05.080
Ah!

21:05.080 --> 21:11.500
I saw until the dragon somehow died,
but what's happened since then?

21:11.750 --> 21:14.500
The first mission has been cleared.

21:14.500 --> 21:16.460
There were four fatalities.

21:17.170 --> 21:19.710
That sounds about right.

21:19.880 --> 21:24.040
That means the four people with no ability
were quickly abandoned, huh?

21:24.290 --> 21:29.000
Two people with no ability
and two S-ranks died.

21:31.540 --> 21:33.920
I did not foresee this.

21:33.920 --> 21:37.080
They died very suddenly and without warning.

21:37.750 --> 21:40.250
Could this be Instant Death magic?

21:41.170 --> 21:45.670
It's baffling that the
system install would fail...

21:46.420 --> 21:49.790
But it's probably not something
worth worrying about.

21:50.250 --> 21:52.210
We must exercise caution.

21:52.210 --> 21:54.920
Youichi-kun, you may do as you see fit.

21:55.630 --> 21:56.580
Yes, ma'am.

23:36.210 --> 23:40.380
<b>"My Guardian Angel is So Overpowered, This Other World is a Piece of Cake!"</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:40.420
"My Guardian Angel is So Overpowered,
This Other World is a Piece of Cake!"
